      "message": "This makes the Blueprint \u003c-\u003e soong_ui / soong_build a bit more messy, but I didn\u0027t want to add even more refactoring to this change.\n\nIf I have time, there are at least the following things that could be improved:\n\n- The concept of \"output file\" (Args.OutFile) can probably go away\n- It\u0027s probably nicer to remove that hardwired \"-d ${out}.d\" argument from the build.ninja rule\n- The build.ninja rule should probably be removed to something else since it now does something else, too\n- Given that we now write a depfile based on the return value of RunBlueprint, passing in extraNinjaDeps to RunBlueprint is not necessary\n- AFAICT the only place where Ninja dependencies are collected in singletons/mutators is globSingleton, so that functionality could be removed in favor of manually adding glob list files to the depfile\n\nThe situation with singleton modules / singletons is kinda unfortunate, but it at least made me realize that AddNinjaDeps() on singleton and module contexts is unnecessary 😊",
